## Stubbed Malware Test: AvarionX vs Dr.Web

Date: 11/10/2026

To test the new Similarity Engine introduced in AvarionX version 4.1.6, a test was ran on 330 samples from August. The same samples from the previous test. A stub file was placed in each to change the hash, closing each engine from its cloud source. 

Note: 4 to 5 samples did not recieve a stub, but they are included in the scores. 

### Scores 
AvarionX: 210 / 330 = 63.64%

Dr.Web: 270 / 330 = 81.82%

